# ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░
# ░░ Sample env variables ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░
# ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░
#
# Environment-specific settings for abcwpstaging
# Shared settings (SERVER_NAME, DB_HOST, DB_USER/PASSWORD, TABLE_PREFIX, TTL, CADDY_ROOT, frontend URLs) are in runtime.env
DB_NAME=your-staging-db-name
WP_ENV=staging
WP_POST_REVISIONS=10
WP_SAVE_TRIGGER_QUEUE_ENABLED=0
WP_SAVE_TRIGGER_TARGET=staging
ASTRO_BUILD_TRIGGER_URL=http://deploy-orchestrator:4011
WP_HOME=https://your-wp-staging-domain.example
WP_SITEURL=https://your-wp-staging-domain.example/wp
DEBUG=true

# WP salts — staging-specific (distinct from dev to prevent session/cookie collisions)
# Generate from https://roots.io/salts.html or https://api.wordpress.org/secret-key/1.1/salt/
AUTH_KEY=generate-me
SECURE_AUTH_KEY=generate-me
LOGGED_IN_KEY=generate-me
NONCE_KEY=generate-me
AUTH_SALT=generate-me
SECURE_AUTH_SALT=generate-me
LOGGED_IN_SALT=generate-me
NONCE_SALT=generate-me
